# THE LAB IS A WORKBENCH, NOT A DELIVERABLE. Only its sources are committed.

# THE FIXTURE IS REAL CUSTOMER CONTENT. `graph.json` is a projection of the
# JSA package — statements, passage excerpts, meeting refs. It is regenerated
# with `npx tsx lab/export-graph.ts <scopeId>` and never committed.
graph.json

# Its own dependency tree (G6, d3-force, react-force-graph, pixi) — 213 MB,
# and separate from the app's on purpose so a prototype's library can never
# reach production's package.json.
node_modules

# esbuild output and the pages it writes.
*.bundle.js
*.bundle.js.map
p0.html
pa.html
pb.html
pb2.html
pb3.html
pc.html

